            "description": "Required native Shadowdark 4.0 effect-key replacement in world-owned Actor and Item packs. Every eligible effect must verify. Core 0.19.1 blocks enumeration if any such pack is locked or unreadable; inspect world Actor/Item pack locks and service-account access in Foundry before retrying. This module never unlocks packs or elevates permissions. An unresolved effect blocks with its identity and repair reason. Intentionally locked packs cannot be excluded under this host's strict required-step policy.",
